        (tune version: 1 name: "Quiet Array" tempo: 92 speed: 3 channels: 8 meter: (8 4) (bus) (instruments) (patterns) (order 0 1 2 3 4 5 6 7 8) (marks calm: 0 fill: 4 tense: 5) (history ("codex" "2026-09-21" "Quiet Array; original F# minor contemplation for Stack / Mahjongg; 92 BPM.") ("codex" "2026-09-21" "Calm order 0-3 (32 bars); transition 4 (4 bars); focused tense 5-8 (32 bars); B05 loops tense. Four composed eight-bar variants per region.") ("codex" "2026-09-21" "Straight sixteenth onsets; melodic notes on eighths. No thirty-second roll or noise riser. Transition percussion uses the main kit and leaves a final-beat breath.") ("codex" "2026-09-21" "Warm low pulse, ceramic clicks and linen brushes under complete mallet phrases. Minor harmonies and an open D/A/C# voicing; focused section adds pulse, clearer mallets and quiet replies.") ("codex" "2026-09-21" "Game-owned original; existing soundtrack sources remain unchanged. Full audition includes the transition; render.py supplies independent calm/tense loops.") ("m1 (marks from the documented layout)" "2026-09-21" "set marks calm: 0 fill: 4 tense: 5"))))
